# Statute downloads that turned out to be the wrong instrument. Both came from
# identifiers constructed by hand and unverifiable behind Cloudflare: sl-2017-0431
# resolved to the Architects Regulation, sl-2020-0736 to a Criminal Procedure fees
# regulation. The content guard in stage 3b caught both; they are excluded so they
# cannot be mistaken for source.
causal/provenance/statute_source/Architects*
causal/provenance/statute_source/a8616745-*
